    <detaileddescription>
<para><ref refid="classthemisdb_1_1replication_1_1_c_d_c_manager" kindref="compound">CDCManager</ref></para>
<para>Captures every WAL entry that passes through the replication pipeline and delivers it to registered consumer callbacks. Consumers can filter by collection name or receive every change.</para>
